# Local development only.
#
# Cloudflare bindings (DB, KV, MEDIA) come from wrangler.jsonc, not from here -
# `wrangler dev` provides them locally with no credentials required.
#
# Real secrets are never stored in this repository:
#   - Deployment credentials live in GitHub Actions secrets
#     (CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID)
#   - Application secrets live in Worker secrets:
#       npx wrangler secret put SESSION_SECRET
#       npx wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) to override deployment variables locally.

# Slug of the village to serve when the hostname matches no `villages.domain`.
DEFAULT_VILLAGE_SLUG=demo
